			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Cocoon and Output artifacts\n\nUpdate Element submodule from b9df80b1 to 6a4ea120, bringing in the latest Cocoon and Output changes:\n\n1. Cocoon (extension host):\n   - Add HydrateUriResults helper to convert string URLs from Mountain's findFiles effect into proper vscode.Uri objects with fsPath/scheme/toString() support\n   - Add FolderContainsGlobViaMountain for glob-based extension activation using findFiles(glob, {maxResults:1}) via gRPC\n   - Activation logic now uses native stat for literal filenames (package.json, Cargo.toml) and Mountain's parallel ignore::WalkBuilder for glob patterns with early-exit\n\n2. Output: Remove Configuration directory (ESBuild, Plugin, Polyfill, Service configs and tsconfig files)\n\nImpact: Extensions now receive proper Uri objects. Glob-based activation leverages Mountain's OS-threaded, gitignore-aware walker for faster activation on large repos. Unused Configuration files removed from bundled output.",
